<title>SINGAPORE: HTP Holdings 1997 net profit flat.</title>
<headline>HTP Holdings 1997 net profit flat.</headline>
<dateline>SINGAPORE 1997-06-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year ended March 31 1997</p>
<p>(in millions of Singapore dollars unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net profit		    5.77   vs  5.71</p>
<p>    Group share (cents)	 3.60   vs  3.50</p>
<p>    Final Dividend (cents)    0.40   vs  0.30</p>
<p>    Bonus dividend (cents)    0.35   vs   nil</p>
<p>    Turnover		     56.49   vs 42.33</p>
<p>    Investment income	   4.25   vs  4.06</p>
<p>    Other income		  3.44   vs  2.88</p>
<p>    Interest expense	    2.00   vs  1.57</p>
<p>    Pretax			  8.28   vs  5.75</p>
<p>    Tax			     2.51   vs  0.05</p>
<p>Note : HTP Holdings Ltd is an investment holding company with property interest in New Zealand.</p>
<p>- Singapore Newsroom 65-8703092</p>
</text>
